{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>【舒淇悼念】資深音樂人黃大煒驚傳離世，享壽61歲，消息曝光後震撼華語樂壇與歌迷圈，也引發各界關注與哀悼。</p><p>據家屬委託律師發出的聲明指出，黃大煒於美國時間6月2日清晨、台灣時間6月3日，在夏威夷家中安詳辭世。聲明也提到，他生前不久才剛宣布移居夏威夷，原本仍對未來音樂計畫充滿期待，希望展開人生與創作的新階段，未料生命驟然畫下句點，令親友與粉絲深感不捨與錯愕。</p><figure><img alt=\"舒淇發文悼念黃大煒。（IG@sqwhat）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260615/1143139631366148096348725.jpeg/nnqaXd-zDTVX0WYS9uhBZ0lWSdLXSgXibnyrrW58q60\"/><figcaption>舒淇發文悼念黃大煒。（IG@sqwhat）</figcaption></figure><p>更多舒淇照片：</p><figure><img alt=\"舒淇（東申未來微博圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250920/1046118158077267968678024.jpeg/zPZt8VZUcG9hz3npW_FPXFvNOVKXSajjbycaVW8nGlU\"/><figcaption>舒淇（東申未來微博圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"舒淇（IG@sqwhat）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250929/1049393426858250240168359.jpeg/2HLWilBExPozhRux_TdDRTZMkouWmad_zWY4p81mOKc\"/><figcaption>舒淇（IG@sqwhat）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"舒淇（IG@sqwhat）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250107/953258713970511872501697.jpeg/W7zNrDzfG4G59TtWyZVtOWXhm9PCfDC_Gu35Lxrt-S8\"/><figcaption>舒淇（IG@sqwhat）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"舒淇（IG@sqwhat）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260123/1091394855004934144018239.jpeg/1INksstPSR5uLDBYBeeWUuggYelbBhnySu9TAUrvUwE\"/><figcaption>舒淇（IG@sqwhat）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"舒淇（IG@sqwhat）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260123/1091394861372280832390781.jpeg/X0hZn1MWzGiIFDlandoSqdpW60BRowfsHvG28h7xtvI\"/><figcaption>舒淇（IG@sqwhat）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"舒淇（IG@sqwhat）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251017/1055990773616480256418306.jpeg/2m6xQhWB20sHyOPQXGJrk2h-_ZMs0CpTuGJ0vbhidL0\"/><figcaption>舒淇（IG@sqwhat）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"舒淇（IG@sqwhat）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260417/1121781498098618368504932.jpeg/qBOHvXbtTU7XAoCl9CkdGP6Jvcj_MuykJ09CpCdPQqQ\"/><figcaption>舒淇（IG@sqwhat）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"舒淇（IG@sqwhat）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260123/1091394859434381312781249.jpeg/HLahv6lBCzK9jxGT7Ih1wIrADTm4N-rDf7ak8X-2pPE\"/><figcaption>舒淇（IG@sqwhat）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"舒淇（IG@sqwhat）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20241219/946377698203668480483256.jpeg/Nr8iF25d7Iu3b3m3mEX4pDW-RR0LAStW8qUzKfKlMyk\"/><figcaption>舒淇（IG@sqwhat）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"舒淇（IG@sqwhat）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251017/1055990782303408128768309.jpeg/-6qXiDz_qEmiqFIOIJtXrCB16VWf8mZCEo8cahKPHGo\"/><figcaption>舒淇（IG@sqwhat）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"舒淇（IG@sqwhat）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250107/953258718873915392352164.jpeg/PpGoElGc00-xt90o6LTF81hvl7YlFoAR1B6me9Qepns\"/><figcaption>舒淇（IG@sqwhat）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"舒淇（IG@sqwhat）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250121/958406407332433920952476.jpeg/eKvRxfa-5Esj_M3Df_O8oP_HKU8UbKIt7mIqge5iKoE\"/><figcaption>舒淇（IG@sqwhat）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"舒淇（IG@sqwhat）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250107/953258715652689920763294.jpeg/W4ozKtPcg6bAwo9SdP1uyfChmEb1dwEOqcoKyKnKCsg\"/><figcaption>舒淇（IG@sqwhat）</figcaption></figure><p>消息傳出後，許多歌迷湧入社群平台留言悼念，回顧他過去在音樂上的經典作品與舞台表現，表達對這位音樂人的不捨之情。</p><p>曾與黃大煒有交情的藝人也陸續發聲悼念，其中影后舒淇在得知消息後，於社群限時動態簡短寫下「一路好走」四字，以最直接卻克制的方式送別故友，也讓不少網友感到鼻酸。</p><p>【延伸閱讀】61歲資深音樂人黃大煒猝逝　家屬證噩耗　曾花逾億台幣救患癌女友（點圖放大瀏覽▼▼▼）</p><figure><img alt=\"【延伸閱讀】61歲資深音樂人黃大煒猝逝　家屬證噩耗　曾花逾億台幣救患癌女友（Facebook@黃大煒 (Huang Dawei)）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260614/1142845341159526400095463.jpeg/mOorlPMSqNbt4ny1IzyRFWZ313rRE673IEku0CBJLtA\"/><figcaption>【延伸閱讀】61歲資深音樂人黃大煒猝逝　家屬證噩耗　曾花逾億台幣救患癌女友（Facebook@黃大煒 (Huang Dawei)）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"知名男歌手黃大煒6月14日傳出猝逝噩耗，家屬透過律師函證實，黃大煒於檀香山時間2026年6月2日早晨，於姊姊家中驟然離世，享壽61歲。（Facebook@黃大煒 (Huang Dawei)）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260614/1142845332149768192253719.jpeg/U0gwk3aE7Wa5zbus52KC30F6Pv2OmtZmqZA05KmQNOQ\"/><figcaption>知名男歌手黃大煒6月14日傳出猝逝噩耗，家屬透過律師函證實，黃大煒於檀香山時間2026年6月2日早晨，於姊姊家中驟然離世，享壽61歲。（Facebook@黃大煒 (Huang Dawei)）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"黃大煒和女友趙瑞芳Vicky（Facebook@黃大煒 (Huang Dawei)）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260614/1142845333844267008685701.jpeg/1DIVtcEu-69JTzqn4sxOnuteUPFeJEfCJKT-iySk_os\"/><figcaption>黃大煒和女友趙瑞芳Vicky（Facebook@黃大煒 (Huang Dawei)）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"黃大煒（Facebook@黃大煒 (Huang Dawei)）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260614/1142845333546471424240591.jpeg/o7G1ELv_2yte2AU2IzGXdImX5HeKh2i0-VbuPPlW7jw\"/><figcaption>黃大煒（Facebook@黃大煒 (Huang Dawei)）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"黃大煒（Facebook@黃大煒 (Huang Dawei)）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260614/1142849454051692544760258.jpeg/7Ti8oi8ePFAXlBoOGDJCdCGFN9ay1FQIcjh1kHI4dZA\"/><figcaption>黃大煒（Facebook@黃大煒 (Huang Dawei)）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"黃大煒（Facebook@黃大煒 (Huang Dawei)）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260614/1142845336029630464013287.jpeg/L_cR-vx2hIfwTWvLfNOY8Qur0jIl_WQDKr84Yyq_OGM\"/><figcaption>黃大煒（Facebook@黃大煒 (Huang Dawei)）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"黃大煒（Facebook@黃大煒 (Huang Dawei)）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260614/1142845338537955328320561.jpeg/my07dCNbQ_iaBmD3M6ZrqasmPrfclpTUkNtWF5DbVhc\"/><figcaption>黃大煒（Facebook@黃大煒 (Huang Dawei)）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"黃大煒（Facebook@黃大煒 (Huang Dawei)）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260614/1142845343567187968764831.jpeg/MPF8EbetLLMD-K-KNYDihMLlzmXgJKFA_kAbBP5AGwQ\"/><figcaption>黃大煒（Facebook@黃大煒 (Huang Dawei)）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"黃大煒（Facebook@黃大煒 (Huang Dawei)）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260614/1142845336113516544825091.jpeg/gWMkFzkWAHbINv4tycQcoiZyIvDT3kN9v5rKzr-ays4\"/><figcaption>黃大煒（Facebook@黃大煒 (Huang Dawei)）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"黃大煒（Facebook@黃大煒 (Huang Dawei)）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260614/1142845338340823040386751.jpeg/eBV-OZS61osHFGIJliOPl83-Oj6TXzQEE8lJ2xPJSds\"/><figcaption>黃大煒（Facebook@黃大煒 (Huang Dawei)）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"黃大煒（Facebook@黃大煒 (Huang Dawei)）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260614/1142845340685570048465273.jpeg/GIQxI6lBE-Mg5Gub2AYoU4pcN2PcyQr6Pv9gmD7_YJg\"/><figcaption>黃大煒（Facebook@黃大煒 (Huang Dawei)）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"黃大煒（Facebook@黃大煒 (Huang Dawei)）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260614/1142845343059677184786531.jpeg/xL2OlpXzirwFuFXNLT4q2u_sPppqKnxXzNCh4MzQoeA\"/><figcaption>黃大煒（Facebook@黃大煒 (Huang Dawei)）</figcaption></figure><p>48歲舒淇深夜突曬素顏照「好久沒有露臉」 網友好驚訝</p><p>舒淇首當導演重回「最美天橋鏡頭」地點 指點女主角9m88</p><p>【本文獲「聯合新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-15T03:42:19.849328+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1140,"images":26,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}